    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Sacr. cor. Prol.">
        <head>Prom. Reg. Sacr. cor. Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis gewrit is gewriten stǽf be stæfe be þam gewrite þe Dunstan arcebisceop sealde urum hlaforde æt Cingestune, þa on dæg þa hine man halgode to cinge, ⁊ forbead him ælc wedd to syllanne butan þysan wedde þe he up on Cristes weofod léde, swa se bisceop him dihte:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This document has been copied, letter by letter, from that which Archbishop Dunstan gave to our lord at Kingston, on the day when he was consecrated as king, forbidding him to give any pledge except this one which he laid upon Christ's altar, as the bishop directed him:</ab>
      </div>
